WEBVTT

00:05:28.962 --> 00:05:32.392
gelukkig, lewend met 'n doel en klaarheid,

00:05:32.392 --> 00:05:34.292
meeste van die tyd.

00:05:34.292 --> 00:05:38.113
So mag boeke altyd met julle wees.

00:05:38.113 --> 00:05:39.431
Dankie.

00:05:39.431 --> 00:05:41.429
(Applous)

00:05:41.429 --> 00:05:43.854
Dankie. (Applous)

00:05:44.954 --> 00:05:47.317
Dankie. (Applous)